[1m[38;5;231mWho uses this app, and where does the data live?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m Single user, browser-only
     [38;5;246mOne person, localStorage, no server. Notifications = in-app + browser Notification API, driven by due dates and [39m
     [38;5;246mreminders.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Multi-user with a server
     [38;5;246mReal accounts, shared tasks, a backend. Cross-person notifications, optional email/push. Much larger build.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Browser now, server-ready
     [38;5;246mShip single-user against a storage interface, so a backend can be added later without rewriting the task model.[39m
